            <ArticleTitle>Structure-activity relationship of flavanone. Anti-degranulation activity of 7-O-substituted hesperetin.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2137-2142</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1080/14786419.2017.1280486</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A series of 7-O-substituted hesperetins was evaluated for degranulation-inhibiting activity in rat basophil leukaemia cells. 7-O-Methyl and 7-O-ethyl hesperetin exhibited potent anti-degranulation activity compared with the original hesperetin.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
